      "NodeType": "CodeBlockNode",
      "Code": "BL;\nTL;\nBLO;\nTLO;\n\ncolumns;\n\ncolumnsTopLevel = Element.GetParameterValueByName(columns, TL);\ncolumnsTopLevelOffset = Element.GetParameterValueByName(columns, TLO);\ncolumnsBaseLevel = Element.GetParameterValueByName(columns, BL);\ncolumnsBaseLevelOffset = Element.GetParameterValueByName(columns, BLO);\n\ncolumnsTopLevelElev = Math.Round(columnsTopLevel.Elevation + columnsTopLevelOffset);\ncolumnsBaseLevelElev = Math.Round(columnsBaseLevel.Elevation + columnsBaseLevelOffset);\n\ngeo = Element.GetLocation(columns);\nx1 = DSCore.Object.Type(geo)==\"Autodesk.DesignScript.Geometry.Point\"? Point.X(geo): Point.X(Line.StartPoint(geo));\ny1 = DSCore.Object.Type(geo)==\"Autodesk.DesignScript.Geometry.Point\"? Point.Y(geo): Point.Y(Line.StartPoint(geo));\nz1 = columnsBaseLevelElev;\nx2 = DSCore.Object.Type(geo)==\"Autodesk.DesignScript.Geometry.Point\"? x1: Point.X(Line.EndPoint(geo));\ny2 = DSCore.Object.Type(geo)==\"Autodesk.DesignScript.Geometry.Point\"? y1: Point.Y(Line.EndPoint(geo));\nz2 = columnsTopLevelElev;\npStart = Point.ByCoordinates(x1, y1, z1);\npEnd = Point.ByCoordinates(x2, y2, z2);\ncolumnLine = Line.ByStartPointEndPoint(pStart, pEnd);",
