      "ConcreteType": "Dynamo.Graph.Nodes.CodeBlockNodeModel, DynamoCore",
      "NodeType": "CodeBlockNode",
      "Code": "zeroLowLevelElev;\nzeroHighLevelElev;\nstairs;\nL;\nLO;\n\nstairsLevel = Element.GetParameterValueByName(stairs, L);\nstairsLevelOffset = Element.GetParameterValueByName(stairs, LO);\n\nstairsElev = Math.Round(stairsLevel.Elevation + stairsLevelOffset);\n\nbool1 = stairsElev>=zeroHighLevelElev;\nfilter1 = List.FilterByBoolMask(stairs, bool1);\n\nstairsAboveZero1 = Dictionary.ValueAtKey(filter1, \"in\");\nstairsToInspect = Dictionary.ValueAtKey(filter1, \"out\");",
